This work has the LPPL maintenance status `maintained'.
The Current Maintainer of this work is Punpiti Piamsa-nga.

This work consists of the files kuthesis.cls, kuthesis.bbx, kuthesis.cbx,
example-th.tex, example-en.tex, references.bib, latexmkrc, install.sh,
install.ps1, AI-CONVERT.md, AI-SETUP.md, workspace/AGENTS.md,
workspace/CLAUDE.md, draft-template/*, docs/index.html and .vscode/*.

The thesis templates in draft-template/ may be filled in and used freely;
the text a student writes into them belongs to the student.

This is not an official publication of Kasetsart University.

The emblem images in logo/ are marks of Kasetsart University, extracted from
the Graduate School's thesis manual. They are NOT covered by the LPPL and are
included only so that theses for Kasetsart University can be prepared.
